    "神": 2
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "35001",
      "subQuestName": "由通关3地城解锁$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3090201": {
            "id": "3090201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呼，可算是全部处理完了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090202"
            ]
          },
          "3090202": {
            "id": "3090202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这样蒙德的元素流动、地脉循环就会恢复正常了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090203"
            ]
          },
          "3090203": {
            "id": "3090203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "要回去看看<color=#00E1FFFF>骑士团</color>的情况吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090204"
            ]
          },
          "3090204": {
            "id": "3090204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "当然，如果有什么别的有趣的事要做，我也可以陪你先去喔。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090205"
            ]
          },
          "3090205": {
            "id": "3090205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "比如去蒙德购物…或者一起再去看看<color=#00E1FFFF>七天神像</color>？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090206"
            ]
          },
          "3090206": {
            "id": "3090206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "之前我们在四风守护的庙宇里，得到了一种好像凝固的风一样的东西吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090207"
            ]
          },
          "3090207": {
            "id": "3090207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "在蒙德，人们把它叫做「散失的风神瞳」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090208"
            ]
          },
          "3090208": {
            "id": "3090208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这个名字代表的是：它有资格被镶嵌在神像的眼眶里。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090209"
            ]
          },
          "3090209": {
            "id": "3090209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "有童话说，是燕子衔走了作为眼睛的宝石…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090210"
            ]
          },
          "3090210": {
            "id": "3090210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "但其实「散失的风神瞳」本来就没有实体。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090212"
            ]
          },
          "3090212": {
            "id": "3090212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "拥有「神之眼」的人会注意收集它们，送去<color=#00E1FFFF>七天神像</color>，获取赐福。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090213"
            ]
          },
          "3090213": {
            "id": "3090213",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "虽然你没有「神之眼」，但你超脱这个世界的常理…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090214"
            ]
          },
          "3090214": {
            "id": "3090214",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "想试试的话，就出发吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090215"
            ]
          },
          "3090215": {
            "id": "3090215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "风起地的那座七天神像，应该就是离我们最近的一座。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3090216"
            ]
          },
          "3090216": {
            "id": "3090216",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我很期待…这一次，神明又会怎样回应你！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35000",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3500001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3500001": {
            "id": "3500001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35001",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3500101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3500101": {
            "id": "3500101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "前面的区域以后再来探索吧？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35003",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3500301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3500301": {
            "id": "3500301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "世界崩坏之后，两颗陨星落在世界中央",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500302"
            ]
          },
          "3500302": {
            "id": "3500302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "降临大地的双子，正有一人将要醒来",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500303"
            ]
          },
          "3500303": {
            "id": "3500303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你从极寒中复苏，希望与这世界相处愉快",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500304"
            ]
          },
          "3500304": {
            "id": "3500304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#然而当你睁眼，却见到{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTER]}正被锁链刺穿——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500305"
            ]
          },
          "3500305": {
            "id": "3500305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "陌生的神灵自天而降，带走了你唯一的血亲",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500306"
            ]
          },
          "3500306": {
            "id": "3500306",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "而你的复仇却被神阻止，陷入充满噩梦的沉眠……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500307"
            ]
          },
          "3500307": {
            "id": "3500307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "再度醒来，天地间风景已变",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500308"
            ]
          },
          "3500308": {
            "id": "3500308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "自己究竟又沉睡了多少年？这也无从知晓",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500309"
            ]
          },
          "3500309": {
            "id": "3500309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "于是你孤身一人踏上旅途",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500310"
            ]
          },
          "3500310": {
            "id": "3500310",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "去寻找曾经目睹的神灵……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500311"
            ]
          },
          "3500311": {
            "id": "3500311",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "两个月后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "35004",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3500401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3500401": {
            "id": "3500401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "所以说，你们是从世界之外…漂流来的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500402"
            ]
          },
          "3500402": {
            "id": "3500402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "但在你们想要离开这里、前往下一个世界的时候…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500403"
            ]
          },
          "3500403": {
            "id": "3500403",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "却有陌生的神灵，拦在你们的面前？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500404"
            ]
          },
          "3500404": {
            "id": "3500404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "神",
            "text": "外来之人，你们的旅途到此为止",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500405"
            ]
          },
          "3500405": {
            "id": "3500405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "什么人？！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500406"
            ]
          },
          "3500406": {
            "id": "3500406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "神",
            "text": "「天理」的维系者，在此终结「人之子」的僭越",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500417"
            ]
          },
          "3500417": {
            "id": "3500417",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "荧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500418"
            ]
          },
          "3500418": {
            "id": "3500418",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "空！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500424"
            ]
          },
          "3500424": {
            "id": "3500424",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#等等…别走！把我的{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTER]}——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500425"
            ]
          },
          "3500425": {
            "id": "3500425",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#就这样，陌生的神灵带走了我的{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTER]}——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500426"
            ]
          },
          "3500426": {
            "id": "3500426",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我也被神封印，失去了原本的力量",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500427"
            ]
          },
          "3500427": {
            "id": "3500427",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "曾经跨越诸多世界的我们，受困于此…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500428"
            ]
          },
          "3500428": {
            "id": "3500428",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那究竟是多少年前的事呢？我不知道…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500429"
            ]
          },
          "3500429": {
            "id": "3500429",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "但我会想办法查清楚的",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500430"
            ]
          },
          "3500430": {
            "id": "3500430",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "醒来以后我总是一个人流浪，直到两个月前，遇到了你…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500431"
            ]
          },
          "3500431": {
            "id": "3500431",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯，那时多亏了你！否则我大概已经淹死了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500432"
            ]
          },
          "3500432": {
            "id": "3500432",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "所以，我会努力做一个好向导的",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3500434"
            ]
          },
          "3500434": {
            "id": "3500434",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "该出发了，我们走吧"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}